 "sources": [
  "tools/JavaCreativeTabs.java: every SpawnEggItem, SpawnEggItem.getType, EntityType.getCategory and isAllowedInPeaceful; the order is the spawn_eggs tab's, then registry order for the eggs no tab lists (`in_tab` false)",
  "`class`: the class EntityTypes' factory for the egg's type constructs (javap -v of EntityTypes). `baby`: SpawnEggItem.spawnOffspringFromSpawnEgg on a matching mob: `breed` for an AgeableMob whose nearest getBreedOffspring is not just `return null`; `set_baby` for another Mob whose class overrides setBaby below Mob; else `none` (no offspring, the use passes). The Ender Dragon is not a Mob",
  "assets/minecraft/textures/item/<egg>.png: base and spot colours are the means of a two-cluster split of the opaque interior pixels (outline excluded), larger cluster first",
  "assets/minecraft/lang/en_us.json (names)"
 ],
